-- `fst` of a pair whose first field is the point 1.0 (a zero factor,
-- shifted): the projection is that point, whatever the other field is (task
-- dirac-law-point-lost-under-plus-or-helper; the rewrite-invariance net's
-- tuple-law family reaches the same shape with a constant second field).
p(1.0)=(1.0, 0.0)
p(0.0) is impossible
